  job: "Drafts SEO-friendly product descriptions for the shop's website, helped write the employee handbook and daily to-do lists, works out tricky measurements for event installs, and drafts marketing aimed at specific customer types.",
  story: "Brandy Ferrer owns Simply Beautiful Floral Company in Gilmer, Texas, and calls ChatGPT a 'little assistant' that's available around the clock. \"A lot of little time-consuming tasks keep me away from the design table,\" she told Oasis Floral Products. She uses it to write brief, keyword-rich descriptions for arrangements on her website so the shop shows up when people search for flowers in Gilmer. ChatGPT also helped her create an employee handbook based on her preferences and state and federal law, and a set of daily and weekly to-do lists (her shop's 'little Bible') that she refined by giving it feedback. For a wedding in a 30-by-60-foot tent, the bride changed the garland plan to run corner to corner; Brandy asked ChatGPT for the length and learned each run needed about 43 feet, not the 32 feet she had planned.",
  results: ["Writing product descriptions with ChatGPT \"can save me hours and helps me move up in the search engine,\" Brandy says.", "The garland calculation kept her from running short on a wedding job: \"ChatGPT's calculations saved her time and money,\" per the article.", "\"It's not replacing me, but it's definitely saving me time.\" The article gives no dollar or hour totals."],
  tools: ["ChatGPT (OpenAI)", "Image generation inside ChatGPT for social media ideas"],
