  results: ["The inventory tool saves Denny's wife six hours a month on complex beer tax calculations.", "Sales reconciliation time has been cut by multiple hours each week.", "The source credits these efficiencies with helping sales grow 24% year over year, against a 4% global industry decline.", "Its Google Business Profile drew 97,000 visitors to the farm last year without paid advertising.", "\"It's not just about saving time, it's about shifting where my energy goes,\" Denny says.", "Note: this is a Google case study (the vendor); it gives no cost or build time."],
